WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:02.024
- If I can experiment during college,

00:00:02.024 --> 00:00:04.123
McDonald's can experiment with flavors.

00:00:06.047 --> 00:00:07.841
