kind of hanging out on top.

00:00:30.761 --> 00:00:33.301
- It does kind of look
like it could be cement.

00:00:33.301 --> 00:00:35.373
But I think that's just the Oreo flecks.

00:00:35.373 --> 00:00:37.100
- It already looks too rich for me.

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:39.356
I would have done without
the crumbles on top.

00:00:39.356 --> 00:00:40.371
- Oh, you gotta have the crumbles.

00:00:40.371 --> 00:00:41.042
- Nah, nah, nah, this is a bit much.

00:00:41.042 --> 00:00:43.263
- This is Oreos we're talking about here.

00:00:44.801 --> 00:00:47.077
- I can taste the coffee a
bit more than I expected.

00:00:47.077 --> 00:00:48.877
- This is an Oreo water.

00:00:48.877 --> 00:00:50.617
- It's super sweet.

00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:54.397
Heavy, refreshing, it's like
all things that are good.

00:00:54.397 --> 00:00:56.062
- There's no coffee in this.

00:00:56.062 --> 00:00:57.362
I call bull(beep).

00:00:57.362 --> 00:00:59.354
- Some great textures going on in here.

00:00:59.354 --> 00:01:00.675
It's like chewing good rocks.

00:01:00.675 --> 00:01:02.199
- It's just so sweet.

00:01:02.199 --> 00:01:03.905
The only way I can drink this is like,

00:01:03.905 --> 00:01:05.916
you know those little
hamster water dispensers?

00:01:05.916 --> 00:01:07.447
Where it's like doop, doop, doop, doop.

00:01:07.827 --> 00:01:09.128
- Look, I commend McDonald's

00:01:09.128 --> 00:01:12.460
for really pushing the
boundaries and trying stuff.

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.723
But I feel like they have a
long history of doing things

00:01:15.723 --> 00:01:16.833
that they don't need to do.

00:01:16.833 --> 00:01:18.621
- If they're gonna serve
this for breakfast,

00:01:18.621 --> 00:01:21.181
then I want breakfast
twenty-four hours at McDonald's.

00:01:21.181 --> 00:01:22.806
- This has got "hit" written all over it.

00:01:22.806 --> 00:01:23.842
- What about some alcohol?

00:01:23.842 --> 00:01:25.082
- Yeah, put some alcohol in there.

00:01:25.082 --> 00:01:25.996
Put some rum in there.

00:01:25.996 --> 00:01:27.926
- McDonald's after dark.

00:01:27.926 --> 00:01:30.223
- They could make like a
cookies and cream, that's like.

00:01:30.223 --> 00:01:31.624
- I think that's what Oreos are.

00:01:31.624 --> 00:01:32.558
- Oh, sh(beep).

00:01:32.558 --> 00:01:34.204
- The secret agents at
McDonald's like snuck

00:01:34.204 --> 00:01:36.032
into the Starbucks
laboratory and were like,

00:01:36.032 --> 00:01:37.272
we gotta get all the frappe.

00:01:37.272 --> 00:01:38.858
Let's get all the frappe recipes.

00:01:38.858 --> 00:01:40.015
And then like, the cops came

00:01:40.015 --> 00:01:42.052
